        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: o levantamento",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "o levantamento — \"the cash withdrawal; the survey\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Fiz um levantamento no multibanco. I made a withdrawal at the cash machine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Levantar dinheiro — to withdraw cash."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "levantamento is built on levantar 'to lift, to raise', which goes back to Latin levāre 'to lighten, to raise' (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
